   the small space on both sides, and a 2px bar spans its label at its foot, where a component sets the row's hairline.
   The tab chosen takes the ground's ink (whatever quieter tone its component rests it in) and its bar in the brand
   colour, or the ground's ink on dark and brand grounds, so it is marked by more than colour; under the pointer the
   others take the ink and a faint bar, and darker while pressed, instead of an underline, so nothing moves. The focus
   ring sits inside the tab, clear of the bar, where a row that scrolls sideways cannot clip it. */
